  "description": "The TPE floor mats are 100% safe, 100% odorless and eco-friendly in all weathers (rain, fog, snow, etc.). They provide an excellent rugged and durable grip. Absolutely no slipping.\nFeatures\nSnap-on. The clips hold the pad securely to the floor preventing any movement or slippage, providing a safe and comfortable driving experience.\n3D Laser Scan design. The 3D design fits perfectly to the walls of the vehicle's footwell, providing better protection for your interior.\nHerringbone-pattern design. OEDRO floor mats feature a deep molded herringbone pattern that traps all liquids and dirt, ensuring your rugs stay like new!\nRaised edges. OEDRO floor mats have raised edges to prevent any spills, mud, and grime from coming into contact with your carpet.\n2 Year Warranty Guarantee & For your safety, professional installation is highly appreciated and recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet Tahoe with 2nd Row Bucket Seats.\nCompatible with 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 GMC Yukon(Yukon Denali) with 2nd Row Bucket Seats.",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
